{"id":"n66231-4-2","stage":0,"title":"맞다 · 是","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n66231-4-2-1","ko":"이 지갑 네 것 맞아?","zh":"这个钱包是你的吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个。","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"지갑","meaning":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","explanation":"지갑：钱包，钱夹，钱袋。","readings":[{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31502","senseId":"1","lemma":"지갑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지갑","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"你的","explanation":"네：너 的所有格形式，意为“你的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"(某人)的","explanation":"것：(某人)的。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"3","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"맞아?","meaning":"是你的吧","explanation":"맞다：是、没错；这里确认钱包是不是对方的。","readings":[{"term":"맞다","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66231","senseId":"4","lemma":"맞다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"맞아","audio":"/audio/c92874385c2bbee2ea2e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"523a0f1558bc4c4d","term":"지갑","zh":"钱包，钱夹，钱袋","audio":"/audio/523a0f1558bc4c4dce2b.mp3","entryId":"31502","definition":"为便于携带钱、卡、名片等物品，用皮或布料制作的小包。","pronunciation":["지갑"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者；네 것 是“你的东西”。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"(某人)的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某人的所有物。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"6d08580e9b088153","term":"맞다","zh":"是","audio":"/audio/6d08580e9b08815338a6.mp3","entryId":"66231","definition":"某物是某人的而没有差错。","pronunciation":["맏따"]}],"audio":"/audio/eefa01d6102a3742fc87.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n66231-4-2-2","ko":"응, 안 그래도 없어져서 찾고 있었는데.","zh":"嗯，正好钱包不见了，我一直在找呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"嗯","explanation":"응：非敬语肯定回应，意为“嗯”。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"正好（안 그래도）","explanation":"안 그래도 是固定表达，意为“正好、本来就”；这里并非普通的否定词 안。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"그래도","meaning":"本来就（안 그래도）","explanation":"안 그래도 是固定表达，说明说话人本来就在找钱包。","readings":[{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36264","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그래도","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3"}},{"text":"없어져서","meaning":"因为不见了","explanation":"없어지다：消失、不见；-어서 表示后面寻找钱包的原因。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어져서","audio":"/audio/aa2135fcbe99d00097e0.mp3"}},{"text":"찾고","meaning":"寻找","explanation":"찾다：寻找；-고 与后面的 있다 构成持续进行的动作。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾고","audio":"/audio/88e9378eb172b1c95ae4.mp3"}},{"text":"있었는데.","meaning":"一直在……呢","explanation":"-고 있다 表示动作持续；-었- 表示过去，-는데 在句末交代背景、留有余意。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었는데","audio":"/audio/2d342a4ef128538b404b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"嗯","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"对朋友或晚辈的话作肯定回应。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"正好（안 그래도）","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"与 그래도 构成固定表达 안 그래도，表示“正好、本来就”。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"82bd547e58bb6509","term":"그래도","zh":"本来就（안 그래도）","audio":"/audio/82bd547e58bb6509909c.mp3","entryId":"36264","definition":"与 안 构成固定表达 안 그래도，表示“正好、本来就”。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不存在；与 -어지다 合用为 없어지다，表示不见了。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"寻找","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了得到某物而四处寻找；这里指找钱包。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/617afb41e7f5a3aa1301.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.26,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=66231","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"4","sourceLevel":"초급","day":26,"sequenceScore":1.1189,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这个钱包是你的吗？","嗯，正好钱包不见了，我一直在找呢。","你昨晚几点回家的？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个钱包是你的吗？","嗯，正好钱包不见了，我一直在找呢。","你昨晚几点回家的？"],"answer":1}]}
